###### Reference ############################################################
#
# Each step produces ONE OUTPUT PER LEG, all three sharing one run number and
# one measurement counter, each with its own folder, its own _metadata.hdf and
# its own DM job. The names agree up to the detector label:
#
#   data/G0203_HEA-Att_a0022_f003000_rigaku3M_r00001
#   data/G0203_HEA-Att_a0022_f003000_eiger4M_r00001
#   data/G0203_HEA-Att_a0022_f003000_lambda2M_r00001
#
# Only internally-timed modes may share a beam window (eiger4M/Internal Series,
# lambda2M/Internal, rigaku3M_epics/EPICS). A mode that gates the beam through
# softglue cannot sit alongside one that does not, and is rejected at dry-run.
#
# `shutter_owner` is gone as of 2026-09-11 -- a protocol that still sets it is
# rejected. Delete the line rather than carrying it forward.
#
# The parallel protocols for the earlier part of this experiment live in
# trio_measurement_info.yaml, reached by dry_run_trio_measurement_info() /
# run_trio_measurement_info(). Its trio_att5 / trio_att2 / trio_att1 blocks are
# a different, shorter series -- not these.
#
